 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nBluepeak Industries Inc                                      MASTER SERVICES\n742 Evergreen Terrace, 62701 Springfield, United States     AGREEMENT\nVAT No: US40-1021911\nReg No: US-243424\n\nFROM                                                         BILL TO\nBluepeak Industries Inc                                      Crestview Supplies LLC\n742 Evergreen Terrace                                        88 Commerce Drive\n62701 Springfield                                            44101 Cleveland\nUnited States                                                United States\nVAT: US40-1021911\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 05/28/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Bluepeak\nIndustries Inc, with its registered office at 742 Evergreen Terrace, Springfield (\"Party A\"), and Crestview Supplies LLC, with its registered\noffice at 88 Commerce Drive, Cleveland (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by Swedish law.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A      Bluepeak Industries Inc / Sarah Mitchell\nParty B      Crestview Supplies LLC / David Kim\nDate         05/28/2026",
